<h1>Peak Apparel Co. Inventory Management System</h1>
<p>CS340 Group 15 &middot; Julie Glass and Abhijeet Singh</p>

<h2>Pages</h2>
<ul>
    <li>
        <a href="/customers">Customers</a>
        &mdash; browse customers, add a new customer, update contact details, remove a customer
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/orders">Orders</a>
        &mdash; browse orders, create an order for a customer, update order details, remove an order
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/orderitems">Order Items</a>
        &mdash; browse the line items on each order, add an item to an order, change the item or quantity on a line, remove a line item
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/inventory">Inventory</a>
        &mdash; browse stocked products, add a new product, update pricing and stock levels
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/distributors">Distributors</a>
        &mdash; browse distributors, add a new distributor, update contact details
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/purchases">Purchases</a>
        &mdash; browse purchase orders placed with distributors, create a purchase order, update or remove one
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/purchaseitems">Purchase Items</a>
        &mdash; browse the line items on each purchase order, add an item to a purchase, change the item or quantity on a line, remove a line item
    </li>
</ul>